 <h3><u>Imam e zamana ka ashiq bana de</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Khudaya mukadar mera yun jagade<br> Imame zamana ka aashik banade</p> 
  <p>Meri maa ki koshish ka usko sila de<br> Imame zamana ka aaashiq banade</p> 
  <p>1. Karun zikr zehra ka tahir banun me<br> imaame zamana ka nasir banun me<br> meri maa ki koshish ka usko sila de<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>2. Har ek dilko azme hussaini aata ho<br> har ek jaa ko jooshe khuaini aata ho<br> gutan ki fazao me taza hawa de<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>3. Zamane ki chaalo se ghabra gaya hun<br> gunaaho ki duniya se tang aagaya hun<br> gunaaho ki zindaa se mujhko chuda de<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>4. Aata kar jawano ko akber ki himmat<br> mille mere bacho ko asger ki himmat<br> khudaya unhe muskurana sikhade<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>5. Meri maa ki khwahish fidaye hussaini<br> he ghutti me meri aazaye hussaini<br> aaza par me jaa dun mujhe hausla de<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>6. Amal se hi apni gawahi likhun me<br> imame zamaa ka sipahi banun me<br> shahadat k raste pe chalna sikhade<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
  <p>7. Ho akhlaaq pyaara to meethi zaba hoon<br> kamar do jahano me yun shadmaan ho<br> dua dun me jisko mujhe wo dua de<br> imame zamana ka aashiq banade</p> 
